{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Death Park 2 \u2013 Survive the horror, save your sister, and uncover the origin of the clown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this terrifying sequel, you\u2019ll explore a nightmare-ridden city filled with monsters, traps, and twisted secrets. A killer clown is back\u2026 and this time, the fate of your sister and Farland itself depends on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move between the real world and the world of sleep to solve puzzles, fight terrifying creatures, and face your worst fears. Every decision you make shapes the story, and only a few players will see the true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd21 <strong>Scary clown and terrifying monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Unique puzzles</strong> with two difficulty modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>8 massive locations</strong>: city streets, hospital, sewers, cemetery, military base &amp; more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Two worlds to explore</strong> \u2013 reality and nightmares</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiple endings</strong> \u2013 your decisions matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong> and creepy sound design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>First-person shooter</strong> with action &amp; stealth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 Can you handle what lurks in the shadows? Or will the clown claim the lives of your family?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adventure\u2019s beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1525890/c3c17fc73e6e46bf8252ec5f422675401616d77f.jpg"},{"name":"Finding Narnia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1525890/8